spice
* NMOS Amplifier Circuit
VDD 1 0 DC Vdd_value
? Missing component
Cin 6 0 Cin_value
RD 1 2 RD_value
M1 2 6 4 4 NMOS_MODEL
* Define NMOS Model Parameters (example)
.model NMOS_MODEL NMOS (LEVEL=1 KP=120u VTO=1)
* Voltage and Component Values
.param Vdd_value=5
.param Vn_ac_value=0
.param Cin_value=10n
.param RD_value=1k
* Simulation Commands
.tran 1n 10u
.end
